{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a casual puzzle game , it is perfect for training your observation. In the game, there are numerous hidden spots on the character's accessories and background. You need to spot 5 to 15 differences in each stage to complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Butterfly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl named Yingtai whom you encounter by chance in a garden. She is desperately searching for her lost memories and the person she has been longing for all her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Azure &amp; White Serpent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enchanting serpent sisters you meet by West Lake. On a rainy day, beneath an ancient bridge, they share a single oil-paper umbrella\u2014a scene that feels strangely familiar\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Zombie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown zombie suddenly lunges at you from a mass grave. The scars on her body seem to tell a tragic story of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Cat Demon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mischievous cat demon girl who breaks into your room at night. Under the bright moonlight, her lively eyes fix on you with curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Exorcist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl in ancient attire whom you meet after crossing into another world. She seems to hold the key to the hidden secrets of exorcists\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435690?t=1761988025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435690?t=1761988025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435690/eea49377c5a38651d2cba674f9997e1481ab7940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761988025","capsule_im